    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2022-june/q3",
      "question": "<p>The triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"PQR\"></span> is such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PQ} = 3\\mathbf{i} + 5\\mathbf{j}\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PR} = 13\\mathbf{i} - 15\\mathbf{j}\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{QR}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\overrightarrow{QR}|\"></span> giving your answer as a simplified surd.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S\"></span> lies on the line segment <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"QR\"></span> so that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"QS:SR = 3:2\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(c) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PS}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
