      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2022-june/q6",
      "question": "<p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find the first 4 terms, in ascending powers of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, of the binomial expansion of</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(3 - \\frac{2x}{9}\\right)^8\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving each term in simplest form.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x) = \\left(\\frac{x-1}{2x}\\right)\\left(3 - \\frac{2x}{9}\\right)^8\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the coefficient of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2\"></span> in the series expansion of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\"></span>, giving your answer as a simplified fraction.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
