      "question": "<figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:114mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-8ma0-01-2022-june/q11-figure.svg\" alt=\"Figure 3. Circle C and line l.\"></figure><p>Figure 3 shows the circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> with equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2 + y^2 - 10x - 8y + 32 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>and the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> with equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2y + x + 6 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(i) the coordinates of the centre of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>,</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(ii) the radius of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the shortest distance between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
