      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2022-june/q13",
      "question": "<p>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</p><p>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Show that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{1}{\\cos \\theta} + \\tan \\theta \\equiv \\frac{\\cos \\theta}{1 - \\sin \\theta} \\quad \\theta \\neq (2n + 1)90^\\circ \\quad n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cos 2x \\neq 0\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) solve for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0 &lt; x &lt; 90^\\circ\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{1}{\\cos 2x} + \\tan 2x = 3\\cos 2x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving your answers to one decimal place.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
